th a higher potential score.  \nReason: By discarding B2, the remaining B tiles (B4, B5, B6) can be discarded or used in a meld later, while the T suit tiles can form three consecutive Chows (T4-T5-T6, T7-T8-T9) and a pair of T7, maximizing scoring potential.  \nAnswer: Play B2"}
